---
// Static graphical method diagram for the worked example: the 2
// constraint lines, small arrows marking each half-space's feasible
// side, the shaded feasible region, and its 4 vertices.
import AxesFigure from "./primitives/axes-figure.astro";
import ArrowMarker from "./primitives/arrow-marker.astro";
---

<AxesFigure title="Graphical Method Worked Example" yLabel="x₂" xLabel="x₁">
  <defs>
    <ArrowMarker id="gmd-arrow" variant="open" />
  </defs>

  <polygon class="region" points="50,290 250,290 200,240 50,190"></polygon>

  <line class="curve tone-s5" x1="50" y1="90" x2="250" y2="290"></line>
  <line class="curve tone-ct" x1="50" y1="190" x2="350" y2="290"></line>

  <line
    class="halfplane-arrow tone-s5"
    x1="150"
    y1="190"
    x2="137"
    y2="203"
    marker-end="url(#gmd-arrow)"
  ></line>
  <line
    class="halfplane-arrow tone-ct"
    x1="200"
    y1="240"
    x2="194"
    y2="257"
    marker-end="url(#gmd-arrow)"
  ></line>

  <text class="curve-label tone-s5" x="150" y="130">
    x₁ + x₂ = 4
  </text>
  <text class="curve-label tone-ct" x="255" y="255">
    x₁ + 3x₂ = 6
  </text>

  <circle class="pt tone-ink" cx="50" cy="290" r="5"></circle>
  <text class="pt-label" x="34" y="308">
    (0,0)
  </text>

  <circle class="pt tone-ink" cx="250" cy="290" r="5"></circle>
  <text class="pt-label" x="234" y="308">
    (4,0)
  </text>

  <circle class="pt tone-pt" cx="200" cy="240" r="5.5"></circle>
  <text class="pt-label" x="206" y="230">
    (3,1)
  </text>

  <circle class="pt tone-ink" cx="50" cy="190" r="5"></circle>
  <text class="pt-label" x="14" y="185">
    (0,2)
  </text>

  <Fragment slot="caption">
    The feasible region is bounded by <span class="tone-s5">x₁ + x₂ ≤ 4</span>,
    <span class="tone-ct">x₁ + 3x₂ ≤ 6</span>, and the axes. Arrows mark the
    feasible side of each constraint line. The optimal vertex
    <span class="tone-pt">(3,1)</span> is where the 2 lines intersect.
  </Fragment>
</AxesFigure>

<style>
  .region {
    fill: var(--s5);
    fill-opacity: 0.15;
    stroke: none;
  }

  .halfplane-arrow {
    stroke: var(--tone);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .pt-label {
    fill: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
